广场搭建的戏台，热闹非凡。",canSee=1,caozuoName1="观看",buttonShow1=0,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"CYN一曲终了，明日再来观看吧。NOR"}}},buttonShow2=1,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="inroom",args={"any","hdroom1005"}}}},autoResult1={{type="rdresults",args={{1,1,1,1},{{{"change",{"rwwp36","rwwp36a"}}},{{"change",{"rwwp36","rwwp36b"}}},{{"change",{"rwwp36","rwwp36c"}}},{{"change",{"rwwp36","rwwp36d"}}}}}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={}},rwwp36a={id="rwwp36a",name="戏台",dsc="临时在广场搭建的戏台，热闹非凡。",canSee=1,caozuoName1="观看",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"CYN报幕人上面鞠了一躬，原本吵吵嚷嚷的戏园子逐渐安静下来。幕后传来吹拉弹唱之声，戏子登台，脍炙人口的昆曲《桃花扇》便要上演了。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL梨花似雪草如烟，春在秦淮两岸边，一带妆楼临水盖，家家粉影照婵娟。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL人不见，烟已昏，击筑弹铗与谁论。黄尘变，红日滚，一篇诗话易沉沦。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN侯方域与李香君的故事被戏子婉婉唱来，你心中一动，不禁陷入沉思。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN第一出的戏子下台，下一出的戏子走到台前，开始了第二出表演。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL高皇帝在九京，不管亡家破鼎，那知他圣子神孙，反不如飘蓬断梗。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL十七年忧国如病，呼不应天灵祖灵，调不来亲兵救兵，白练无情，送君王一命。伤心煞煤山私幸， 独殉了社稷苍生，独殉了社稷苍生！NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN爱恨情仇与国破家亡交织在一起，不仅惹得众人一片唏嘘。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL问秦淮旧日窗寮，破纸迎风，坏槛当潮，目断魂消。当年粉黛，何处笙箫? 罢灯船端阳不闹，收酒旗重九无聊。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL当年粉黛，何处笙箫？罢灯船端阳不闹，收酒旗重九无聊。白鸟飘飘，绿水滔滔。嫩黄花有些蝶飞，新红叶无个人瞧。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN故事最终悲剧结尾，你从戏中惊醒，不觉已经双眼湿润，感悟颇深。NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}}},caozuoName2="观看",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"CYN一曲终了，明日再来观看吧。NOR"}}},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={}},rwwp36b={id="rwwp36b",name="戏台",dsc="临时在广场搭建的戏台，热闹非凡。",canSee=1,caozuoName1="观看",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"YEL春色撩人，爱花风如扇，柳烟成阵。行过处，辨不出紫陌红尘。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL香肩斜靠，携手下阶行。一片明河当殿横，罗衣陡觉夜凉生。唯应，和你悄语低言，海誓山盟。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN声声宛转，句句缠绵，唐玄宗与杨玉环的感情真挚而热烈，你不禁深深陶醉其中。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL霓裳天上声，墙外行人听。音节明，宫商正，风内高低应。偷从笛里写出无馀剩。人散曲终红楼静，半墙残月摇花影。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL临别殷勤重寄词，词中无限情思。七月七夕长生殿，夜半无人私语时，谁知道比翼分飞连理死，绵绵恨无尽止。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN两人的爱情跌宕起伏，却终成眷属。一曲终了，你心中澎湃万千。NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}}},caozuoName2="观看",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"CYN一曲终了，明日再来观看吧。NOR"}}},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={}},rwwp36c={id="rwwp36c",name="戏台",dsc="临时在广场搭建的戏台，热闹非凡。",canSee=1,caozuoName1="观看",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"YEL非是我临国难袖手不问，见帅印又勾起多少前情。杨家将舍身忘家把社稷定，凯歌还人受恩宠我添新坟。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL庆升平朝堂内群小争进，烽烟起却又把元帅印送到杨门。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN杨门女将的故事脍炙人口，你不禁开始热血奋腾起来。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL有生之日责当尽，寸土怎能够属于他人。番王小丑何足论，我一剑能挡百万兵。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL我不挂帅谁挂帅，我不领兵谁领兵！叫侍儿快与我把戎装端整，抱帅印到校场指挥三军。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN戏终人散，巾帼不让须眉的豪言壮语却依旧在你胸中回荡不去。NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}}},caozuoName2="观看",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"CYN一曲终了，明日再来观看吧。NOR"}}},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={}},rwwp36d={id="rwwp36d",name="戏台",dsc="临时在广场搭建的戏台，热闹非凡。",canSee=1,caozuoName1="观看",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"CYN台下逐渐安静下来，弦鸣之声响起，一名戏子面带愁容缓缓走出，凄凄地唱了出来。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL仙吕·点绛唇满腹闲愁，数年禁受，天知否？天若是知我情由，怕不待和天瘦。混江龙则问那黄昏白昼，两般儿忘餐废寝几时休？NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL大都来昨宵梦里，和着这今日心头。地久天长难过遣，旧愁新怅几时休？则这业艰苦，双眉皱，越觉的情怀冗冗，心绪悠悠。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN这出戏唱的是窦娥冤，你心中沉沉如水，却也不知道是何种滋味。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN戏子换了身衣裳，重新登上戏台，第二出开始了。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL忽听得唤窦娥愁锁眉上，想起了老婆婆好不凄凉。只见她发了怒有话难讲，禁妈妈呼唤我所为哪桩？NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL我哭哭一声禁妈妈，我叫叫一声禁大娘，想窦娥遭了这不白冤枉，家有银钱尽花光，哪有余钱来奉上，望求妈妈你、你、你行善良。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN戏子言之凄凄，想到窦娥的遭遇，你愁绪翻涌，心头悲凉。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN第二出结束后，四下寂静一片，众人都陷入沉默。悠然的乐声由远及近，最后的诀别即将上演。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL有日月朝暮悬，有鬼神掌著生死权。天地也，只合把清浊分辨，可怎生糊突了盗跖、颜渊。为善的受贫穷更命短，造恶的享富贵又寿延。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL天地也，做得个怕硬欺软，却原来也这般顺水推船。地也，你不分好歹何为地？天也，你错勘贤愚枉做天！哎，只落得两泪涟涟。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={2,"少侠稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN戏曲终了，但窦娥声声泣血的悲恸与无奈的嘶吼呐喊让你不禁潸然泪下。NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}}},caozuoName2="观看",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"CYN一曲终了，明日再来观看吧。NOR"}}},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={}},rwwp37={id="rwwp37",name="看台",dsc="卖艺人搭建的看台。",canSee=1,caozuoName1="观看",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"你往看台看去，只见卖艺人上下翻飞，看得你眼花缭乱，不禁拍手叫好。"}}},buttonShow2=1,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={}},rwwp38={id="rwwp38",name="铜锣",dsc="卖艺人的铜锣，用来收集赏钱。",canSee=1,caozuoName1="打赏",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"你往铜锣里丢了点钱。"}}},buttonShow2=1,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="k